[gd_scene load_steps=19 format=3]

; zone_cinderlands — the land of fire (act 2, map three; A2-01, 2026-10-02), band 35–40.
;
; Past the marsh the ground is black glass and the air is ash. A road crosses it from the south-east
; corner toward the north-west and stops at the forge. Ember hounds run by the way in, the orc clans
; hold two camps east of the road, salamanders and wasps the rift of open fire, the shamans a ring of
; burning stones, and the flats west of the road belong to whatever is fastest. The Burning Warlord
; holds the forge camp in the north-west, spikes all round, behind his guard.
;
; Everything the player walks on or into is a kit piece naming an id; woods and clutter are
; ScatterNodes, seeded. Every creature is tuning in game/data/zones/act2.json. This file is
; coordinates. Written by `kiln scenes` from src/Kiln.Tools/Commands/Act2Layouts.cs: change the
; layout, not this file.

